convertible-helper (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: resets the screen to normal when a convertible leaves
    tablet mode; handles the Toughbook CF-19 rotation and security buttons
    in any shell state. Replaces the GNOME Shell code that did this.
  * Enables the on-screen keyboard setting in tablet mode (restored on
    leaving it), through the public accessibility setting.

 -- Bruce Perens <bruce@perens.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:00:00 -0700
